# A call in `included do` runs on the including class itself, so Ruby asks
# for a class method. Widget has `stamp!` only as an instance method, and the
# residue said "no class that includes it defines `stamp!`" — false. It now
# says which side was asked, and hover repeats the resolver's words.
def app.rb:11:5 status=residue reason=method
hover app.rb:11:5 as a class method
# An instance-side call in the module: the includers lack it. The module is
# named now.
def app.rb:15:5 status=residue reason=Trackable
# A module nothing mixes in says that.
def app.rb:28:5 status=residue reason=Loose
